docs {
  # Open Orders

  Backed by the Webull v3 endpoint GET /trading/orders/open-orders/list.

  Returns currently resting/working orders only — includes the GTC stop-loss and
  take-profit bracket orders placed by the strategies that have not yet filled.

  ## Pagination
  - `pageSize` — max records per page (default 50)
  - `lastId`   — pagination cursor for the next page (disabled by default)

  ## Responses
  - `200` — { orders, count, timestamp }
  - `502` — Webull error; includes `webullError` (httpStatus + rawResponse)
}
